OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks wider public space
OL,4,Acrime powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn east London council is consulting on
OL,7,Fa plan that could criminalise
OL,8,Fantisocial behaviour including drinking
OL,9,Fin public and aggressive begging across
OL,10,Fthe entire borough.
OL,12,FHavering Council is looking to expand a
OL,13,FPublic Spaces Protection Order (PSPO)
OL,14,Fthat would grant its officers and the
OL,15,FMet Police extended powers to issue
OL,16,Ffines.
OL,18,FThe Reform-led council said it would be
OL,19,Fan expansion of the Romford PSPO, which
OL,20,Fgives a constable or an "authorised
OL,21,Fperson" the ability to fine people #100
OL,22,Fon the spot for a range of offences.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
