OL,3,GNEWSACouncil seeks wider public space
OL,4,Acrime powers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn January, Haringey Council, which
OL,7,Falso has a borough-wide PSPO, said it
OL,8,Fwould reconsider the order as it was
OL,9,Flikely to cause "significant risk of
OL,10,Fharm" to "marginalised" people.
